      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadibo baluhuka, bakabatendekena ne, Nutuambile mei â kabidi Lumingu lualua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamuangalaka bantu, Bena Yuda ba bungi ne bitabushi bimpe ba bualu bua Bena Yuda bakalonda Paulo ne Bânaba; bobo bakabambila ne, Nunanukile mu ngasa wa Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakalua Lumingu lukuabo lua Bayuda, bantu bonso ba mu musoko bakadisangisha bua kunvua dî dia Nzambi, anu bakese bakashala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamona Bena Yuda bisumbu bia bantu nunku, bakûlangana tente ne mukau, bakadila mei akadi Paulo wamba, bakamuhenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo ne Bânaba bakajukuila bantu, bakamba ne, Butuakadi nʼabu mbua kunuambila nuenu dî dia Nzambi diambedi. Kadi bualu bua nuenu nudi nuhidia dî edi, ne nudi nudilumbuluila bualu buenu ne, Katuena bantu bakane ba kuangata muoyo wa tshiendelele, tuetu netuye kudi bantu ba bisamba bia bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Mukelenge wakatulela mikenshi ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
